  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF IAP Sanski Most 2004 - LWF Sanski Most 2004</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LWF IAP Sanski Most 2004</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of 350 houses for returnees and IDPs in six municipalities in North West BiH during 2004 until February 2004. The project includes smaller infrastructure projects as complement to the housing repairs, agricultural components in order to facilitate an economic independence for the returnees, as well as measures for local development within a pilot municipality.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;teruppbyggnad av 350 bost&#xe4;der f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande flyktingar och internflyktingar i sex kommuner i nordv&#xe4;stra BiH under 2004 fram till februari 2005. I projektet ing&#xe5;r &#xe4;ven mindre infrastrukturprojekt som komplement till husreparationerna, jordbruksinsatser f&#xf6;r att underl&#xe4;tta ett ekonomiskt oberoende f&#xf6;r dem som &#xe5;terv&#xe4;nder, samt &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder f&#xf6;r kommunal utveckling i en f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;kskommun.</narrative>
  </description>
